{"id":"d25297b7-5bfa-5283-ae6a-da5f8e524904","title":"Page File Format","icon":"📄","cover":"none","parentId":"c68ed360-d4f3-50ae-9c0b-3592b669b21b","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"Page File Format","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"artifact format version 3","title":"The page format on disk","lead":"Each page is a JSON document containing an envelope, nested Page and Board containers, editor blocks, and component references. Use this specification when generating or editing page source files.","facts":[{"label":"Current version","value":"3"},{"label":"Page structure upper limit","value":"16 MiB"},{"label":"Node limit","value":"12,000"},{"label":"Nesting depth","value":"48th floor"}],"art":"concepts"},"integrity":"sha256-6aa1b6a2a0e9657120847e829da416cc95c91acb8b96f04da0960c1b732e5e84"},"id":"node-de4ba1e"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ee4bbb1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What does the file look like?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Expand the structure tree on the left and click on a field to view its meaning and examples. By default, a new page is a Page root container."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-be4b6f8"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"name":"page.showai.json","kind":"object","type":"envelope","open":true,"summary":"A page is a JSON file, and the outermost layer is an envelope.","detail":"`format `is fixed to `showai `and `version `is 3. Versions 1 (normal document) and 2 (old whiteboard) are still readable and stored resources will not be downgraded.","example":"{\n  \"format\": \"showai\",\n  \"version\": 3,\n  \"document\": {\"id\": \"research\", \"title\": \"research\", \"content\": \"…\"}\n}","exampleLang":"json","children":[{"name":"format","kind":"field","type":"\"showai\"","badge":"Required","summary":"Format identifier."},{"name":"version","kind":"field","type":"1 | 2 | 3","badge":"Required","summary":"New resources are always 3.","detail":"Older versions are upgraded on the first controlled save, with the original bytes saved as `migrations/<资源 id>/original-v1.json `or `original-v2.json `."},{"name":"document","kind":"object","type":"page","badge":"Required","open":true,"summary":"The page's metadata, content tree, outlines, and views.","children":[{"name":"id","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"Resource ID that identifies this file.","detail":"Different from `attrs.id `of the root container: the resource ID identifies the file, and the root container ID identifies the content node."},{"name":"title · icon · cover","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"Title, icon and cover.","detail":"Icons can be text or Emoji, HTTP(S) image addresses, or embedded bitmap data."},{"name":"parentId","kind":"field","type":"string | null","summary":"The **project folder** it belongs to.","detail":"This is the location of the resource in the sidebar;`parentId `in the block operation refers to the content container, which is different."},{"name":"favorite · archived","kind":"field","type":"boolean","summary":"Collection and archiving (delete means archiving and hiding)."},{"name":"createdAt · updatedAt","kind":"field","type":"ISO time","summary":"Creation and update time."},{"name":"content","kind":"object","type":"surface","badge":"content tree","open":true,"summary":"Root container: a `surface `node whose `kind `is `page `or `board `.","detail":"Containers can be nested recursively; nested containers must be below a surface or region. All non-text nodes have a **unique and stable**`attrs.id `. The root Page can be set to `attrs.widthMode `:`standard `,`wide `or `full `.","example":"{\n  \"type\": \"surface\",\n  \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"page-root\", \"kind\": \"page\", \"name\": \"Page\"},\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"surface\",\n      \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"board\", \"kind\": \"board\", \"name\": \"Analysis\"},\n      \"content\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}","exampleLang":"json","children":[{"name":"richText","kind":"object","type":"node","summary":"Containers for common editor blocks: paragraphs, titles, lists, tables, etc."},{"name":"region","kind":"object","type":"node","summary":"Layout grouping, mode is flow, grid or free.","detail":"Exclusive fields are mode, columns, and gaps. region does not create a new viewport; children in free mode use local coordinates."},{"name":"surface","kind":"object","type":"node","summary":"Embedded Page or Board module."},{"name":"widget","kind":"object","type":"node","summary":"Component block:`attrs.kind `+`attrs.data `.","example":"{\n  \"type\": \"widget\",\n  \"attrs\": {\n    \"id\": \"metrics-1\",\n    \"kind\": \"metrics\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"title\": \"Results\",\n      \"items\": [{\"label\": \"sample\", \"value\": 120}]\n    }\n  }\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"drawing","kind":"object","type":"node","summary":"The handwriting and shapes in Board have no child nodes."}]},{"name":"layout","kind":"object","type":"{ [nodeId]: frame }","summary":"The bounding box owned by the parent.","detail":"`x `,`y `,`width `, optional `height `and `heightMode `(`fixed `or `auto `).`auto `is only used in the Page module, the Board module maintains a bounded viewport. The children grouped by Board and free use local coordinates, and the children grouped by Page and flow/grid are arranged in tree order.","example":"{\n  \"board\": {\n    \"x\": 0,\n    \"y\": 0,\n    \"width\": 800,\n    \"height\": 460,\n    \"heightMode\": \"fixed\"\n  }\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"surfaceViews","kind":"object","type":"{ [surfaceId]: view }","summary":"Named views and reading order for each layer of containers.","detail":"`initial `is the view id or null,`saved `is the `{id, name, targets}`list, and `readingOrder `is the child node id list. The current scroll, camera, and selection are personal and not written to files.","example":"{\n  \"page-root\": {\"initial\": null, \"saved\": [], \"readingOrder\": [\"board\"]}\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"comments","kind":"array","type":"Comment[]","summary":"`{id, text, createdAt, resolved}`。"},{"name":"templateContext","kind":"object","type":"Optional","summary":"The precise workflow reference recorded when applying the template.","detail":"Contains `format `,`system `and `templates `. It records the workflow and does not grant access to other projects."}]},{"name":"presentation","kind":"field","type":"\"spatial\" | \"reading\"","badge":"Optional","summary":"Presentation mode, default `spatial `.","detail":"Page maintains normal layout in both modes;`reading `projects the root Board into reading order."},{"name":"selection","kind":"object","type":"{ blockIds }","badge":"Optional","summary":"Indicates that this is a partial projection of the page, preserving necessary ancestor containers.","detail":"The `.showai.json `included with the partial export cannot be used to cover the complete page."},{"name":"components","kind":"array","type":"Compiled components[]","badge":"Exported","summary":"Export the component running package after deduplication in the file.","detail":"Each item contains manifest fields,`schema `,`html `sandbox run code,`integrity `, and optionally `inline `mount code. These are compilation output and should not be written by hand."},{"name":"remoteComponents","kind":"array","type":"Release positioning[]","badge":"Exported","summary":"Verified component URL used by exports that require networking.","detail":"Including `ref `,`bundleRef `,`url `,`sha256 `,`bytes `,`manifestUrl `, etc. Only use the positioning returned by the publishing verification, do not write your own."}]}],"initial":"page.showai.json/document/content","caption":"Fields come from src/types.ts and src/surface/validation.mjs."},"integrity":"sha256-5ff06117c9a558c7cf1988e3c3e35dead46fe14e7b640bc438fcf0d0eb66e4ff"},"id":"node-ce4b88b"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💡","tone":"blue","id":"node-11e4c06a"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When using Agent to modify the page, block operations are preferred ("},{"type":"text","text":"page_apply","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":") or template instead of handwriting the entire JSON. The hash, revision and block id are retained when reading and brought back intact when writing."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-28fdd77d"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-12e4c1fd"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"text block"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"richText ","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"The content in follows the editor's JSON tree: each block is"},{"type":"text","text":"{type, attrs?, content?}","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text is"},{"type":"text","text":"{type: \"text\", text, marks?}","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Write in an empty paragraph "},{"type":"text","text":"content: []","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", there cannot be empty text nodes."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fe4bd44"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"type"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7dbd0130"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-58b13b4f"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Content and attributes"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a246921b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-57b139bc"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2ec46a88"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"paragraph","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e4678a93"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d3894284"}},{"type":"tableCell","content